OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSABudget offer understood to include
OL,4,Arevenue raising conditions
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe secretary of state is understood to
OL,7,Fhave presented a set of conditions,
OL,8,Fincluding revenue raising, to be
OL,9,Fattached to any potential deal on a
OL,10,FStormont budget.
OL,12,FSir Chris Bryant is hosting separate
OL,13,Fmeetings with delegations from the four
OL,14,Fparties which make up Northern Ireland
OL,15,FExecutive in a bid to break months of
OL,16,Fdeadlock.
OL,18,FHis conditions are believed to include
OL,19,Fthe executive committing to #200m in
OL,20,Fadditional revenue raising in 2027/28
OL,21,Fand 2028/29.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,416,410,260,120,0,100
